{"availability":"available","full":"juandsep/document-rag-assistant","name":"document-rag-assistant","description":"RAG assistant for business Q&A over a document corpus, with cited sources. Pinecone retrieval, Ollama Cloud generation, MLflow evaluation, Grafana over CloudWatch, serverless on AWS Lambda for ~$0.10/month idle.","category":"Business","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-29T23:01:56Z","updated":"2026-10-13T04:25:19Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":["aws","fastapi","llm","mlflow","opensearch","pinecone","python","rag","retrieval-augmented-generation","streamlit","vector-database"],"demo":"https://document-rag-assistant-portfolio.streamlit.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T02:49:43.408Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T02:49:43.408Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T02:49:43.408Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T08:00:46.000Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-18T16:52:50.528Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-19T02:49:43.408Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Answers business questions over a document corpus, citing the passages each answer comes from, and says so when the documents do not cover a question.","Try the live demo → Ask about the policies, catalog and services of Norte Retail, a fictional store (14 documents: text, Markdown, a Word catalog and PDFs), in Spanish or English. The first question after a quiet spell waits a few seconds while the API wakes up.","A language model answering alone knows nothing about one company's policies, so it either refuses or guesses, and a guess reads exactly like a fact. This service retrieves the relevant passages first, lets the model answer only from them and returns them as sources, so every claim can be checked. On the labelled question set, the same model, graded by an independent judge (DeepSeek) (details):"],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jua